# FIRST MATERIAL			name of the first material in the pair
# SECOND MATERIAL			name of the second material in the pair

# COMBINED FRICTION			the final friction of contacts between objects of the first and second material 
# COMBINED ELASTICITY		the final elasticity of contacts between objects of the first and second material

# NOTES:
#	The order of the names doesn't matter.
#	Friction or elasticity of -1 means the value will be calculated in game normally, based on the LOAD TIME properties of the two materials. 

#
# FIRST MATERIAL					SECOND MATERIAL								COMBINED FRICTION		COMBINED ELASTICITY			
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#CAR_METAL							CONCRETE									-1						0.9	